thym 0

program nested-in-loop
  why: every service the house sells, marked as the house says it and then as what it does now:
       the nested mark runs with each service, as part of its statement's one node.

  takes h: volume                  -- the holotype
  gives i: volume                  -- an isotype

  for each o in h where kind is service
    emit mark (mark o as stated) as verified    -- one node: the inner mark is folded in
  end
  give project h as isotype
end
